{"versions":[{"path":"versions/d21b6115-915e-40c4-bb28-7cff61faebe3/fff872b1a5e4acf4ba37ec625f2db48ab798f23147f654b9d23814e5a29d0f0b.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"d21b6115-915e-40c4-bb28-7cff61faebe3","revision":"sha256:fff872b1a5e4acf4ba37ec625f2db48ab798f23147f654b9d23814e5a29d0f0b","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"COPD患者“呼气相延长, 肺过度充气”的病理生理基础是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"肺弹性回缩力增加","correct":false,"option_id":"acf0a4ed-3c99-480e-afb2-b6990f4b3136"},{"type":"text","content":"小气道炎症狭窄塌陷+肺实质弹性回缩力下降, 呼气阻力增加, 气体滞留","correct":true,"option_id":"e7ff56cb-afaf-42e6-b6af-3341a2cc644c"},{"type":"text","content":"肺表面活性物质大量生成","correct":false,"option_id":"6e9fd22d-8ed4-44c1-9acc-a451d2927a17"},{"type":"text","content":"胸壁顺应性降低为主要原因","correct":false,"option_id":"17ca7599-45ac-4483-99e0-0dd654049d80"},{"type":"text","content":"肺动脉高压直接导致","correct":false,"option_id":"eb768cfb-5aef-4a74-acd1-db9d10aef72a"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"小气道炎症、狭窄及塌陷与肺弹性回缩力下降均可造成呼气气流受限和气体滞留, 产生过度充气。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/198f348f-b1c8-45c2-8e94-7244a57a9fdb/bbd3d3b1c97c34eae0ffbce6f3cc0b0018bb9f149fb983bcb10467a49da8b72e.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"198f348f-b1c8-45c2-8e94-7244a57a9fdb","revision":"sha256:bbd3d3b1c97c34eae0ffbce6f3cc0b0018bb9f149fb983bcb10467a49da8b72e","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"GOLD肺功能分级中, “中度”气流受限(GOLD 2级)指支气管舒张剂后:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"FEV1≥80%预计值","correct":false,"option_id":"0c84485b-7775-4570-9643-b83c78422b2e"},{"type":"text","content":"FEV1为50%~79%预计值","correct":true,"option_id":"ebf6f35e-9057-4470-87ad-51ea9a0f4161"},{"type":"text","content":"FEV1为30%~49%预计值","correct":false,"option_id":"f4de97f5-875b-4ef6-9c82-d767ef72118f"},{"type":"text","content":"FEV1<30%预计值","correct":false,"option_id":"afd70f2c-2445-476d-992d-84fc91f61e3f"},{"type":"text","content":"FEV1/FVC为60%~70%","correct":false,"option_id":"3e6e23df-1b4b-4c0a-8200-5c262630e31b"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"已确认气流阻塞的前提下, GOLD 2对应支气管舒张剂后FEV₁为预计值的50%至不足80%, B为最接近的选项; 分级还要求参考FEV₁/FVC。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/edb0281b-b78b-4188-8fbd-98c8c3d710e8/34a71936bea76562046e12b3107a6f16fd55961a63a28fa95d35f141f4bcfa8f.json","value":{"schema_version":3,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"edb0281b-b78b-4188-8fbd-98c8c3d710e8","revision":"sha256:34a71936bea76562046e12b3107a6f16fd55961a63a28fa95d35f141f4bcfa8f","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"关于COPD与哮喘的肺功能鉴别, 正确的是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"COPD患者DLCO降低, 哮喘患者DLCO正常或升高","correct":false,"option_id":"bc3e51db-099e-4d29-af10-0acf6b6aac50"},{"type":"text","content":"COPD患者舒张试验必定阴性","correct":false,"option_id":"14edcdd5-11c6-46d9-9fc4-55c1e06f7c06"},{"type":"text","content":"哮喘患者RV/TLC必定降低","correct":false,"option_id":"05e531cf-d0aa-4e61-8103-e45e5dfa4cef"},{"type":"text","content":"肺量计正常即可排除哮喘","correct":false,"option_id":"87c328a8-b9d4-4124-8073-f880b7487b9d"},{"type":"text","content":"FEV1下降速度是两者的决定性鉴别点","correct":false,"option_id":"b1d9cf95-a4aa-42f9-b6f0-27bafa7f0583"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"A可能是命题意图: 肺气肿患者DLCO常下降, 哮喘患者通常正常或偏高。但COPD包含不同表型, 并非所有COPD患者DLCO均下降, 而其他因素也会影响DLCO。A缺少必要限定, 暂不判分。"}],"answer_status":"unavailable","selection_mode":"single"}}},{"path":"versions/cbafcd48-9f81-43a9-8b44-5dae82084f0a/de81cf7e08608ae35f7f94eee04acbd14990eb7b319b1f15a9522bdffaae7d3d.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"cbafcd48-9f81-43a9-8b44-5dae82084f0a","revision":"sha256:de81cf7e08608ae35f7f94eee04acbd14990eb7b319b1f15a9522bdffaae7d3d","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"关于吸入糖皮质激素(ICS)在COPD中的应用, 正确的是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"所有COPD患者均应常规单用ICS","correct":false,"option_id":"1dc8b658-5ef8-48dd-9636-19e50f7f4445"},{"type":"text","content":"ICS可单独使用于COPD","correct":false,"option_id":"2bca3ccb-19a3-44b7-afee-96dc1e328a83"},{"type":"text","content":"血EOS≥300/μl, 频繁急性加重或合并哮喘者ICS获益最大, 但ICS增加肺炎风险","correct":true,"option_id":"f4c0e0f7-435a-42d5-a498-52e32a98ab1e"},{"type":"text","content":"ICS可使所有患者的FEV1年下降率归零","correct":false,"option_id":"b0b11c31-4e16-4c5f-8626-791640eb9b99"},{"type":"text","content":"ICS禁忌与LABA/LAMA联合使用","correct":false,"option_id":"8a5d86bf-5341-452f-8bcd-6a88284064e6"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"C最接近ICS用于预防适合患者急性加重的原则, 且ICS有肺炎风险。嗜酸粒细胞水平须结合加重史和当前治疗评估, 单靠EOS≥300不能保证对每名患者获益最大; 合并哮喘需同时遵循哮喘治疗原则。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/605cb53c-4fb5-4ec1-bbb5-5d5276991981/f4d452aacf350b2657771d51c2b3b9076416e22b52787912244096b0fd712bd8.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"605cb53c-4fb5-4ec1-bbb5-5d5276991981","revision":"sha256:f4d452aacf350b2657771d51c2b3b9076416e22b52787912244096b0fd712bd8","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"稳定期COPD“血EOS≥300个/μl, 有急性加重史, 慢性支气管炎表型”的患者, 可考虑的生物制剂是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"奥马珠单抗","correct":false,"option_id":"f8035635-4196-42b9-982b-0bc980632321"},{"type":"text","content":"度普利尤单抗","correct":true,"option_id":"66a17727-3aab-4450-b3e9-4c559d652441"},{"type":"text","content":"美泊利珠单抗仅限哮喘","correct":false,"option_id":"4e8fd12c-046c-40ba-a85a-b7e7c2c01346"},{"type":"text","content":"英夫利西单抗","correct":false,"option_id":"52e4225d-f42e-4997-b156-cc6125a267e0"},{"type":"text","content":"贝伐珠单抗","correct":false,"option_id":"a82b5269-8781-484b-b3bb-81f207e79513"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"度普利尤单抗可作为符合条件、控制不足的嗜酸粒细胞表型COPD患者的附加维持治疗, B为所给选项中最合适者。题干未交代既往治疗及控制程度, 不能仅凭所列指标决定用药; C中“美泊利珠单抗仅限哮喘”已不准确, 美国药品说明也包含特定COPD适应证, 各地批准范围可能不同。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/9c2bc53e-cf93-4af8-ab9a-c7e44649fcf1/bd25e189afc9041d282cf11f1ceae45d680442e1e552de267ddf07bca18e36c3.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"9c2bc53e-cf93-4af8-ab9a-c7e44649fcf1","revision":"sha256:bd25e189afc9041d282cf11f1ceae45d680442e1e552de267ddf07bca18e36c3","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"AECOPD住院患者使用全身糖皮质激素的推荐疗程是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"不超过3天","correct":false,"option_id":"5cbf55d6-6cc4-4368-b6cb-745bff3cff3c"},{"type":"text","content":"5~7天(一般≤5天)","correct":true,"option_id":"1c5c78a9-8476-415e-a55b-bd22562b02a8"},{"type":"text","content":"2周","correct":false,"option_id":"ade0c6de-c82f-4f5c-8e1b-691d04deb7b4"},{"type":"text","content":"4周后直接停药无复发风险","correct":false,"option_id":"fa7bc477-2b3d-4577-b6a8-063c22140021"},{"type":"text","content":"长期维持口服","correct":false,"option_id":"01e1ff08-fdf3-4de8-8856-9b6b32ba2163"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"五天是本组选项中与指南推荐最接近的疗程。B的“5~7天”和“一般≤5天”并列容易引起歧义, 不能据此认为常规需要7天; GOLD 2026推荐5天。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/78b34c9f-3c14-4b2b-b6bf-095c5306ce97/7f8539bfa78c4f0de5575f753b4a77e3352d047404d8a604d4032fbdfa2c8786.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"78b34c9f-3c14-4b2b-b6bf-095c5306ce97","revision":"sha256:7f8539bfa78c4f0de5575f753b4a77e3352d047404d8a604d4032fbdfa2c8786","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"COPD急性加重期氧疗的首要目标是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"使SpO2尽快达到100%","correct":false,"option_id":"5d8df5b9-876f-4919-96f6-8df5c73ce35f"},{"type":"text","content":"维持SpO2 88%~92%, 避免高浓度氧加重CO2潴留","correct":true,"option_id":"bcd81dde-abf7-4ff7-892a-3becce5c2752"},{"type":"text","content":"一律面罩高流量吸氧","correct":false,"option_id":"a4bf487c-e263-45f0-9315-670769b71c04"},{"type":"text","content":"只要呼吸频率降下来即可","correct":false,"option_id":"0bf0d30e-502b-4fbb-895b-d44df1486125"},{"type":"text","content":"先予双水平高浓度正压通气再评估","correct":false,"option_id":"0ad23f93-c727-4c09-87c4-011f0185db8e"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"对有高碳酸血症风险的COPD急性加重患者, 控制性吸氧通常以SpO₂ 88%~92%为初始目标, 并根据血气和个体状况调整, 不应追求所有患者达到100%。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/cb697905-e179-46b8-bf21-4e97db43b8ef/f60490668b6691fa5ad143ff866ac08a7be82846d81e07f71929b3f317d31a3f.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"cb697905-e179-46b8-bf21-4e97db43b8ef","revision":"sha256:f60490668b6691fa5ad143ff866ac08a7be82846d81e07f71929b3f317d31a3f","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"关于COPD预后与长期管理, 错误的是:"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"GOLD分级和ABE分组, 加重史, 合并症均影响预后","correct":false,"option_id":"5753899c-6a1a-48c3-8d79-a51f8453ee03"},{"type":"text","content":"心血管疾病是COPD患者最重要的常见合并症之一, 影响生存","correct":false,"option_id":"fae35d3b-a3c5-4c96-8f04-3875b9c50ef2"},{"type":"text","content":"重度低氧者长期家庭氧疗(≥15小时/天)可降低死亡率","correct":false,"option_id":"e1a72489-00f8-4161-87d3-d3d936a0a8c0"},{"type":"text","content":"戒烟成功后肺功能可完全恢复正常","correct":true,"option_id":"cba35a0b-4241-4a8c-a197-6d93bca4e4be"},{"type":"text","content":"疫苗接种(流感, 肺炎球菌, COVID-19等)可减少下呼吸道感染与急性加重","correct":false,"option_id":"f91f6c6b-275f-40ae-aac5-8863d9226683"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"戒烟可减缓继续吸烟造成的肺功能下降并改善预后, 但已形成的肺部结构损伤通常不能完全逆转; D不能作为普遍结论。"}]}}}]}